It is Friday evening.
The weekend is about to begin.
Before going home, Suresh gathers us all.
Rohan, Priya, Vikram and I go to his desk.
Suresh says, "We have done very good work this week."
"Priya, you have made a beautiful design."
Priya is our designer and she smiles.
Suresh looks at me and Rohan.
"You both have written the new code."
"And Vikram has found all the bugs in the code."
Vikram is our tester and he is also very happy.
Suresh tells us that we have built a solid foundation.
"Thank you all very much."
The meeting ends and we come back to our desks.
I pack my bag.
I have worked with my whole team this week.
Now I truly feel like a valued colleague.
